      "comment": "Agree. a_002 (Male, deceased) and a_007 (Female, spouse) are both evidence_type direct, while the run's own informant_bias_notes say sex was inferred from the given name and the stated spousal role. Inferred is indirect; the run contradicts itself within one assertion set."
